he site's operation or use the publication to distribute harmful content. To the extent permitted by applicable law, material is provided as available without a promise of fitness for your particular purpose. These terms do not remove rights or duties that cannot lawfully be excluded.</p><h2>Changes and questions</h2><p>Material changes will update this notice. Send questions through <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>, and read the <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy notice</a> and <a href="/editorial-policy/">editorial policy</a> for the related practices.</p></article></Base>
